  "body": "The vendors’ circumstances have changed, and they must reluctantly part with this dream site. Their loss is your gain – this section is ready and waiting for its new owners to build the ultimate family home.\r\n\r\nDreaming of building your forever family home? This is your rare opportunity to secure 472m² of prime Castor Bay land – perfectly positioned to capture breathtaking, uninterrupted sea views.\r\n\r\nLiving here means waking up to the ocean every morning, enjoying the coastal breeze, and having top-tier education at your doorstep. This section falls within the highly coveted Westlake Boys’ and Westlake Girls’ High School zones – a massive draw for families seeking both lifestyle and long-term value.\r\n\r\nThis primary location is Easy access to local beaches, cafes, restaurant, and transport links\r\n\r\nDon't delay. Land in Castor Bay with this view, this zoning, and this potential is a rare find. Act now – before someone else secures your view.\r\n\r\nCall today to view the site and start designing your future.",
